  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impl of Increased Disclosure Policy of the Gov of Indonesia under Bank-Financed Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to Government of Indonesia to develop and implement revised disclosure policy to enhance disclosure The Objective of the TF is to assist the Government of Indonesia in developing and carrying out an information disclosure policy to further transparency and accountability in the carrying out of governmental functions. The approach of the TF is to introduce increased disclosure of documents and information relating to government projects, hence making publicly available important documents such as audit reports and procurement documentation.</narrative>
  </description>
